NavelMountain_Text_1:
	.string "TRACEY: Hi, {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "I see you’ve reached NAVEL ISLAND,\n"
	.string "good job!\p"
	.string "The sign at the foot of the\n"
	.string "mountain said that the GYM battle\l"
	.string "is at the top.\p"
	.string "We’ll stay here though.\p"
	.string "Do you have any idea how cold it\n"
	.string "is at the top!?$"

NavelMountain_Text_2:
	.string "MISTY: Hi, {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "DANNY is one of the cutest GYM\n"
	.string "leaders I’ve ever seen.\p"
	.string "You will probably have a hard time\n"
	.string "beating him.$"

NavelMountain_Text_3:
	.string "Aaaah...Geisers...\n"
	.string "One of nature’s wonders.$"

NavelMountain_Text_4:
	.string "Welcome all POKéMON trainers!\p"
	.string "All NAVEL GYM challengers must\n"
	.string "climb to the top of the mountain,\l"
	.string "without using the CABLE CAR.\p"
	.string "All trainers using the CABLE CAR\n"
	.string "will be disqualified.\p"
	.string "Sincerely,\n"
	.string "NAVEL GYM LEADER, DANNY.$"

NavelMountain_Text_5:
	.string "NAVEL MOUNTAIN\n"
	.string "Be sure to bring a jacket.$"

NavelMountain_Text_6:
	.string "WARNING!\p"
	.string "Geisers are very hot, look out\n"
	.string "when you’re near them!$"

NavelMountain_Text_7:
	.string "Welcome all POKéMON trainers!\p"
	.string "From the top, the CABLE CAR is\n"
	.string "free to use for everyone.$"
